  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 864f32d36e36a5644aa8fbd495f2626a, type: 3}
  m_Name: Ashla 3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  line: People have gone missing all across Menari. It's terrible. Everywhere's been
    covered in chaos. The tornado's even been scattering undead skeletons everywhere,
    must have picked a load up from the burial ground in the north. The most concerning
    part is how unnatural it is. We never get Tornados in this part of the world.
    Call me crazy but I think it was conjured specifically to cause this chaos.
  option1:
    text: What do you do out here?
    next: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 301285d48d903944187329a34ea807b7, type: 2}
    action: 0
  option2:
    text: Thanks for the help, Bye.
    next: {fileID: 0}
    action: 0
